<title>SPAIN: Spain's Dominguez starts trading at 7,000 pta.</title>
<headline>Spain's Dominguez starts trading at 7,000 pta.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's fashion house Adolfo Dominguez started trading publicly on the Madrid stock exchange on Tuesday at 7,000 pesetas, versus an initial public offer price at 3,100 for institutional investors.</p>
<p>The retail price in the IPO was 3,007 pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
